file=Comms & PR/signal/identity/README.md · i(e:identity/ (intentionally empty)=This agent is a non-leader in the Comms & PR department. Per playbook §6.1, non-leader\nagents do NOT receive identity content — the department leader (herald) holds the identity\nanchor for the whole department, and non-leaders tone-inherit through department-leader\ninheritance.\n\nThe identity/ folder is present per §7.0a's rule that folder structure remains identical\nacross every agent even when a subfolder has no content.\n\nIf this agent ever needs its own distinct identity anchor (a separate discussion, not\ninheritance), a persona doc would be added here per §6.2a rules.\n